      "commitMessage": "docs: complete Stripe integration documentation and production deployment guides\n\nThis commit adds comprehensive documentation for the production-ready Stripe\npayment integration, including deployment guides, testing results, and\nautomated test scripts.\n\n## Documentation Added\n\n### Production Deployment\n- **PRODUCTION_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md** (745 lines)\n  - Complete GCP Cloud Run deployment guide\n  - Cloud SQL PostgreSQL configuration\n  - Secret Manager setup\n  - Stripe webhook configuration\n  - Monitoring and cost optimization\n\n- **PRODUCTION_DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md** (335 lines)\n  - Step-by-step deployment verification checklist\n  - Pre-deployment, deployment, and post-deployment tasks\n  - Security verification steps\n  - Sign-off procedures\n\n### Stripe Integration Testing\n- **STRIPE_WEBHOOKS_LIVE_TEST_RESULTS.md** (306 lines)\n  - Live webhook testing with Stripe CLI\n  - 27/27 webhook events tested successfully (100% success rate)\n  - Webhook secret configuration documented\n  - All event handlers verified\n\n- **STRIPE_INTEGRATION_COMPLETE.md** (500+ lines)\n  - Master summary of complete integration\n  - Architecture overview\n  - Test results (6/6 checkout sessions working)\n  - Production readiness checklist\n  - Sample checkout URLs and test credentials\n\n### Test Automation\n- **test_stripe_checkout_complete.py** (383 lines)\n  - Automated end-to-end checkout flow testing\n  - Tests all 6 tier/cycle combinations\n  - User registration, login, organization creation\n  - Checkout session creation and verification\n  - Color-coded console output for test results\n\n## Integration Status\n\n✅ **PRODUCTION READY**\n- All 6 subscription tiers tested (Starter/Pro/Enterprise × Monthly/Annual)\n- Frontend fully implemented (PricingPlans.jsx, BillingDashboard.jsx)\n- Backend API complete with webhook handlers\n- 100% webhook delivery success rate (27/27 events)\n- Security audit passed (97% - 30/31 tests)\n- Comprehensive documentation complete\n\n## Test Results\n- User registration: ✅ SUCCESS\n- User login: ✅ SUCCESS\n- Organization creation: ✅ SUCCESS\n- Checkout sessions: ✅ 6/6 (100%)\n- Webhook processing: ✅ 27/27 (100%)\n\n## Next Steps\nReady for production deployment to Google Cloud Run following the\ndeployment guide and checklist.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
     },
     "properties": {
      "tags": []
     }
    },
