      "date": "2025-11-13T04:11:09Z",
      "commitMessage": "Fix all mandate repository tests - 11/11 passing\n\n**Changes:**\n- Added auto-generation of IDs for Intent, Cart, and Payment mandates\n- Added default timestamps for all mandate types\n- Fixed test method calls to match repository API:\n  - get_active_by_user → get_by_user\n  - expire_old_intents → expire_old_mandates\n  - get_by_intent_id → get_by_intent_mandate\n  - get_by_cart_id → get_by_cart_mandate\n  - payment_repo.update → update_status\n- Added timestamp field to all direct IntentMandate creations in tests\n\n**Impact:**\n- All 11 mandate repository tests now passing (was 0/11)\n- Overall test pass rate: 81.4% (227/279 non-skipped tests)\n- Fixed issues: NOT NULL constraint failures, method name mismatches"
     },
     "properties": {
      "tags": []
     }
