      "date": "2025-10-11T17:54:52Z",
      "commitMessage": "Add complete billing and usage tracking system\n\nWeek 1, Day 5: Billing Integration complete ✅\n\nFeatures added:\n- Complete billing models (4 new database tables)\n  - UsageMetric: Track API calls, storage, active users\n  - BillingTier: Define pricing plans and limits\n  - OrganizationSubscription: Manage subscriptions\n  - BillingEvent: Audit log for billing operations\n\n- Billing service with comprehensive features\n  - Automatic usage tracking (API calls, storage, users)\n  - Subscription management (create, get, upgrade)\n  - Usage limit checking and enforcement\n  - GCP Marketplace integration (usage reporting)\n  - Billing tier management (4 tiers: Free, Starter, Pro, Enterprise)\n\n- Complete billing REST API (15 endpoints)\n  - GET /billing/tiers - List pricing plans\n  - POST /billing/subscriptions - Create subscription\n  - GET /billing/usage/{org} - Usage summary\n  - GET /billing/usage/{org}/limits - Check limits\n  - POST /billing/report-usage - Report to GCP\n  - POST /billing/marketplace/entitlement - Handle GCP webhook\n\n- Kubernetes CronJob for automated usage reporting\n  - Runs hourly to report usage to Google Cloud Commerce\n  - Aggregates metrics across all organizations\n  - Error handling and logging\n\n- Pricing plans with usage limits and overage\n  - Free: $0/mo - 1K API calls, 1GB, 3 users\n  - Starter: $29/mo - 10K calls, 10GB, 10 users\n  - Professional: $99/mo - 50K calls, 50GB, 50 users\n  - Enterprise: $299/mo - 1M calls, 500GB, 1K users\n\nTechnical highlights:\n- Usage tracked automatically via service layer\n- Per-organization usage limits enforced\n- Hourly reporting to GCP Marketplace\n- Complete audit trail of billing events\n- Overage pricing for exceeding limits\n- Trial period support (14 days)\n\nDocumentation:\n- BILLING_INTEGRATION.md - Complete setup guide\n- WEEK1_PROGRESS.md - Week 1 summary report\n\nWEEK 1 COMPLETE! 🎉\n- Days 1-2: Docker \u0026 Kubernetes ✅\n- Days 3-4: Helm charts ✅\n- Day 5: Billing integration ✅\n\nMarketplace readiness: 70% → 85% (+15%)\n\nNext: Week 2 - Production polish (monitoring, UI, security)\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
     },
