      "commitMessage": "Implement comprehensive authentication \u0026 authorization system\n\nAdded complete authentication and authorization infrastructure with all requested features:\n\nAuthentication \u0026 Security:\n- OAuth 2.0 authorization code flow with client registration\n- JWT access tokens with refresh token rotation\n- Bcrypt password hashing with strength requirements\n- Session management with device tracking and IP logging\n- User login/logout with automatic token refresh\n- Password reset via email with time-limited tokens\n- 2FA/MFA using TOTP (Google Authenticator compatible)\n- Backup codes for 2FA recovery\n\nUser Management:\n- Complete user CRUD operations with role-based access\n- User registration with email validation\n- Profile management for self and admin users\n- Session listing and revocation per user\n- Account activation/deactivation\n\nRole-Based Access Control (RBAC):\n- Four user roles: admin, manager, accountant, employee\n- Role-based middleware decorators (require_admin, require_manager, etc.)\n- Protected endpoints with role verification\n- Granular permissions per resource type\n\nBackend Implementation:\n- Database models: User, RefreshToken, PasswordResetToken, Session, AuditLog\n- Pydantic schemas for validation and serialization\n- Authentication routes with 14 endpoints\n- User management routes with 7 endpoints\n- OAuth2 routes with authorization and token endpoints\n- Alembic migrations for database schema\n- Setup script for initial admin user creation\n\nFrontend Implementation:\n- AuthContext for global authentication state\n- Login component with 2FA support\n- Register component with password validation\n- ProtectedRoute component for route guards\n- AppWrapper with navigation and user profile\n- Automatic token refresh on API requests\n- Persistent sessions with localStorage\n\nSecurity Features:\n- Audit logging for all authentication events\n- IP address and user agent tracking\n- Session timeout and revocation\n- Password complexity validation\n- Token expiration and refresh\n- CORS configuration\n- Secure cookie handling\n\nDocumentation:\n- AUTHENTICATION.md: Complete feature documentation\n- SETUP_GUIDE.md: Quick start and configuration guide\n- API documentation via FastAPI Swagger UI\n- Environment variable configuration examples\n\nDatabase Schema:\n- 5 new tables with proper foreign keys and indexes\n- Enum type for user roles\n- Timestamps and soft deletes\n- Cascade deletes for related records\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
