      "date": "2025-10-20T00:04:47Z",
      "commitMessage": "Add role-based concurrent session limits and remove ACCOUNTANT role\n\nThis commit implements a comprehensive role-based session management system\nand removes all references to the deprecated ACCOUNTANT role.\n\nNew Features:\n- Role-based concurrent session limits:\n  * EMPLOYEE: 1 concurrent session (single device only)\n  * MANAGER: 2 concurrent sessions (e.g., desktop + mobile)\n  * ADMIN: Unlimited concurrent sessions\n- Automatic session revocation when limits are exceeded\n- Oldest sessions are revoked first\n- All session revocations logged in audit trail (session.auto_revoked)\n\nSecurity Improvements:\n- Prevents unauthorized account sharing\n- Balances security with user convenience\n- Full audit trail for all session management actions\n- Sessions track IP address and User-Agent\n\nCode Changes:\n- Added ROLE_SESSION_LIMITS configuration in src/auth.py\n- Enhanced create_session() to enforce role-based limits\n- Removed all ACCOUNTANT role references from:\n  * src/auth.py (removed require_accountant)\n  * src/routes/users.py (3 permission checks)\n  * src/routes/receipts.py (2 permission checks)\n  * src/api.py (manager notification query)\n\nDocumentation:\n- Added comprehensive SESSION MANAGEMENT section to docs/START_APP.txt\n- Updated all user passwords to \"AgentTest!\" in documentation\n- Updated version to 2.1.0\n- Moved PERMISSIONS.md to docs/ directory\n- Added detailed examples of session limit behavior\n\nUtilities:\n- Added reset_passwords.py script for bulk password resets\n- Added utility components for role management (RoleBadge, roleThemes)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
